//! One plugin per provider, each registering the models that provider serves.
//!
//! The models come from pi's model catalog, revision
//! `sha256-4cbd75daee429216860f6e5b7e13b4ddb12b495f6947061e5777edd27ce0b4f1`:
//! <https://pi.dev/api/models/revisions/sha256-4cbd75daee429216860f6e5b7e13b4ddb12b495f6947061e5777edd27ce0b4f1?types=chat>.
//!
//! Add the plugin of the provider your sampler talks to. One model id can have
//! different limits and prices at different providers, so if two added plugins
//! list the same id, the one added last wins.
//!
//! Generated by `generate_providers.py`; edit that instead.

